			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 140110201,
					"content": "很感谢娜维娅女士的体谅，说实话我也不知道自己是否做好了准备。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110202,
					"content": "逃避往往是最方便的选择，但它没法解决任何问题，也不能帮助你跨越任何障碍。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110203,
					"content": "怪不得说到白淞镇的时候，你有点犹豫。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110204,
					"content": "是啊，要说不害怕是不可能的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110205,
					"content": "但我还是觉得，我应该再来这里一趟。就像之前我说的那样，我想看看那些不曾亲眼所见的东西。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110206,
					"content": "如果这里的人愿意原谅我，那我会很开心，但他们如果暴言相向，我也会全盘接受。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110207,
					"content": "估计也有人不相信娜维娅的说辞。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110208
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140110208,
					"content": "是啊，我能感觉到那些视线。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110209,
					"content": "可能他们觉得，穿着水神戏服到白淞镇来，本就是对这里居民的一种不尊重的行为。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110210,
					"content": "我曾经很害怕被人注视，尤其是被质疑被怨恨的时候。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110211,
					"content": "…哎，看来我还是没有做好准备啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110212,
					"content": "没想到你对自己还挺严格呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110213,
						140110215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110213,
					"content": "是不是有点用力过度了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110214
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140110214,
					"content": "我不能只看我想看到的东西啊，那不就和以前一样了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110217,
					"content": "你们看，是不是人逐渐变多了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110218,
					"content": "议论的声音越来越明显了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110219
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140110219,
					"content": "我们还是别在这里久留吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110220,
					"content": "刺玫会的大船，从那里能看到整个白淞镇吧，我们到那里去看看。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110215,
					"content": "相当意外。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110216
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140110216,
					"content": "什么意思，难道在你眼里我只会东躲西藏，逃避责任吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 1401103,
			"completionStepIds": [
				1401104
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"1401104",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 1401104,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"芙宁娜"
				],
				"points": [
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							2831.178,
							397.924,
							4164.861
						],
						"pointId": 5834
					},
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							2829.195,
							397.926,
							4164.68
						],
						"pointId": 5844
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 140110301,
					"content": "抱歉，或许你们是散步的心情，但我尽是在说一些沉重的话题。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110302,
					"content": "没关系，这样的你也挺新鲜的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110303,
					"content": "嗯，再多陪我一会儿吧，谢谢你们了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110304,
					"content": "或许你们也能感受到，我排斥接纳过去的自己，其实不单单是因为忍受了太久的痛苦与孤独。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110305,
					"content": "站在船边，我的脑中都有当时水逐渐上涨的画面。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110306,
					"content": "一个又一个的生命融化成水，白淞镇镇民无比珍惜的生活与回忆化为泡影。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110307,
					"content": "在神明的庇护之下，人们笃信在灾难降临之前，会有强大的存在挺身而出。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110308,
					"content": "我也曾经为了让他们相信确有其事，而不断地表演…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110309,
					"content": "可是当水真的涨上来的时候，「水神」无动于衷。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110310,
					"content": "也不能这么说啊，那时的你有你的职责。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110311,
					"content": "不用这么苛责自己。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110312
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140110312,
					"content": "为了守护真相，我一直在经历相似的事，越是这样我就越痛苦，越孤独。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110313,
					"content": "逐渐地，我除了真相一无所有，我也害怕我会彻底失败，坐在我的位置上痛哭流涕。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110314,
					"content": "好在有你们，还有诸多英雄的帮助，我们回避了最坏的结局。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110315,
					"content": "所有人都担负起了身上的责任，而我，重归自由…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110316,
					"content": "仔细想想的话，自由不就是不被需要的意思嘛，因为我也没什么用处了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110317,
					"content": "没想到你会这么想。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110318,
					"content": "自由是对你的嘉奖。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110319
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140110319,
					"content": "嘉奖？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110320,
						140110321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110320,
					"content": "至少你可以勇敢说出心里话了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110322
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140110322,
					"content": "…是啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110323,
					"content": "有能够倾诉的人，在过去简直是想都不敢想的事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110324,
					"content": "因为必须坚守重要的秘密，我非常害怕他人注意到真实的我。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110325,
					"content": "「相信舞台上的芙宁娜便好，那就是你们应该信任的形象。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110326,
					"content": "而在生活中，无论是好奇心，还是源自内心的情绪，都不能让人注意到。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110327
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110327,
					"content": "这也是为什么之前我会说，我不是个会好好维持友善关系的人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110328
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110328,
					"content": "原来是这样，我以为只是你私下的性格容易被人讨厌呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110329
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110329,
					"content": "你今天总是和我唱反调！像你这样说话才会让人讨厌吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110330,
						140110331
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110330,
					"content": "派蒙不想让你太消沉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110332
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140110332,
					"content": "嗯，曾经的我只有真相，如今终于解脱。虽然暂时还不知道要走向何方，但…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110333
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110333,
					"content": "我有选择的资格了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110334
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110334,
					"content": "好了，也差不多该回去了。估计剧本的结局已经写好了吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110335
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙宁娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110335,
					"content": "嗯，好，那我们回去看看。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 140110331,
					"content": "说出来果然好多了吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110332
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140110321,
					"content": "至少你不再痛苦与孤独了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140110322
					]
				}
			]
		},
